"""120 independently specified speaking practice sets; never used as mock exams.

Compact authoring format: theme | Part 1 (4) | cue | cue bullets (4) | Part 3 (4).
Questions deliberately avoid assuming employment, travel abroad or costly possessions.
These are original practice prompts, not predicted or recalled examination questions.
"""

